                                                "sense_id": "4eaba60f-f9aa-3b26-a337-d0dcfde1ba3c",
                                                "text": "\"Haven't you heard?\" said Belinda. \"Joan's ill! She'd got a high temperature, and she's in bed in the San.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dff4b8a8-4a86-4346-b350-5264df5520b5",
                                                "sense_id": "4eaba60f-f9aa-3b26-a337-d0dcfde1ba3c",
                                                "text": "‘I was in the san for ten months before the war. I know all the gen about being sick.’"
                                            },
